      "grouping_at_time": "Subpart D \u2014 Design And Construction",
      "title_at_revision": "Protection of structure",
      "text": "Each part of the structure must \u2013\n(a) Be suitably protected against deterioration or loss of strength in service due to any cause, including \u2013\n  (1) Weathering;\n  (2) Corrosion; and\n  (3) Abrasion; and\n(b) Have adequate provisions for ventilation and drainage.",
